      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i checked the payload and everything looks technically sound on my end. if the fields are present and the formatting is right, could it be something more subtle, like a mismatch in the API version or an issue with the idempotency keys? also, how can i isolate whether the issue is with my request structure versus the actual card being rejected by the bank?",
